#: polyhost/host.py:3067 polyhost/host.py:3081 polyhost/host.py:3127
#: polyhost/host.py:3136 polyhost/host.py:3142
msgid "Install WinCompose"
msgstr "Instal WinCompose"

#: polyhost/host.py:3068
msgid ""
"WinCompose lets your PolyKybd type any unicode character on Windows — emoji, accents and the language layers all go through it. Without it the keyboard falls back to the far more limited native Windows input.\n"
"\n"
"PolyKybd's build of WinCompose will be downloaded from GitHub and its installer started (Windows will ask you to confirm)."
msgstr ""
"WinCompose memungkinkan PolyKybd mengetik karakter unicode apa pun di Windows — emoji, aksen, dan lapisan bahasa semuanya melewatinya. Tanpanya, keyboard kembali ke input native Windows yang jauh lebih terbatas.\n"
"\n"
"Build WinCompose dari PolyKybd akan diunduh dari GitHub dan penginstalnya dijalankan (Windows akan meminta Anda mengonfirmasi)."

#: polyhost/host.py:3081
msgid "Looking for the latest WinCompose release…"
msgstr "Mencari rilis WinCompose terbaru…"

#: polyhost/host.py:3128
msgid ""
"No ready-made installer was found for download.\n"
"\n"
"The releases page will open in your browser — download and run the setup from there."
msgstr ""
"Tidak ditemukan penginstal siap pakai untuk diunduh.\n"
"\n"
"Halaman rilis akan terbuka di browser Anda — unduh dan jalankan setup dari sana."

#: polyhost/host.py:3137
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The download failed:\n"
"\n"
"{error}"
msgstr ""
"Unduhan gagal:\n"
"\n"
"{error}"

#: polyhost/host.py:3143
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The installer could not be started:\n"
"\n"
"{error}\n"
"\n"
"It was saved to:\n"
"{path}"
msgstr ""
"Penginstal tidak dapat dijalankan:\n"
"\n"
"{error}\n"
"\n"
"File disimpan di:\n"
"{path}"

#: polyhost/host.py:3151
msgid "The WinCompose installer has started. Once it finishes and WinCompose is running, PolyKybd will switch to it automatically."
msgstr "Penginstal WinCompose telah dijalankan. Setelah selesai dan WinCompose berjalan, PolyKybd akan beralih menggunakannya secara otomatis."

